  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Weather; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 650 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nOnce lit (normally a full-round action, or a standard action with a tindertwig), this incense will continue to smoke in a 10-foot square for 10 hours. Creatures who spend at least 10 minutes inside the cloud of smoke treat weather outside the smoke 2 steps less severe.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Weather sphere (Clear Skies (mantle, all)); <strong>Cost</strong> 375 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
